@page
@model MossHarper.Pages.IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Independent property advisory";
}
<section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow light">Independent property &amp; operational advisory</p>
            <h1>Expertise for complex property challenges<span>.</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-lead">Senior-led advice for residential and mixed-use estates.</p>
            <p class="hero-detail">Managing agent performance, service-charge scrutiny, building safety, operational transformation and complex property disputes.</p>
            <a class="button button-cream" asp-page="/Contact" asp-fragment="contact">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-aside">
            <span class="aside-line"></span>
            <p class="eyebrow gold">Founder-led expertise</p>
            <p>Julian Harper-Brown<br /><small>MTPI, AssocRICS</small></p>
            <small>Former Managing Director and senior property executive with over 18 years’ experience in residential and complex mixed-use estate management.</small>
        </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-foot"><span>Independent advice. Practical outcomes.</span><span>01 / 04</span></div>
</section>
<section class="audience section-pad">
    <div class="container two-col">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Who we work with</p><h2>Clear thinking for every side of an estate.</h2></div>
        <div><p>Developers and investors · Freeholders and asset owners · Managing agents and property businesses · RMC and RTM directors · Leaseholders and resident groups</p></div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="services" class="services section-pad">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where we can help</p>
        <div class="section-heading"><h2>Experienced perspective.<br /><em>Practical direction.</em></h2><p>Seven areas of support across property performance, transformation, building safety and early resolution.</p></div>
        <div class="service-list">
            <article><span>01</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="managing-agent">Independent Managing Agent &amp; Operational Reviews</a></h3><p>Independent scrutiny of management performance, service delivery and accountability.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="service-charge">Service Charge Reviews &amp; Financial Performance</a></h3><p>Establishing whether expenditure is appropriate, justified and reflected in the services delivered.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
            <article><span>03</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="transformation">Strategic &amp; Operational Transformation</a></h3><p>Restructuring teams, improving operating models and strengthening performance through practical change.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
            <article><span>04</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="building-safety">Building Safety &amp; Regulatory Compliance</a></h3><p>Operational support for higher-risk buildings, building-safety governance and regulator engagement.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
            <article><span>05</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="heat-networks">Heat Networks &amp; Utility Management</a></h3><p>Clarifying performance, costs and responsibilities as heat networks enter Ofgem regulation.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
            <article><span>06</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="resident-engagement">Resident Engagement &amp; Communication</a></h3><p>Helping property businesses communicate clearly, respond consistently and rebuild confidence.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
            <article><span>07</span><div><h3><a asp-page="/Services" asp-fragment="dispute-resolution">Early Dispute Assessment, Resolution &amp; Tribunal Support</a></h3><p>Assessing the facts and respective positions early, before disputes escalate unnecessarily.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="approach" class="approach section-pad">
    <div class="container"><p class="eyebrow light">The Moss Harper approach</p><h2>Assess. Advise. <em>Deliver.</em></h2>
        <div class="approach-grid">
            <div><span>01 / Assess</span><p>Establish the facts, understand the underlying causes and evaluate operational, commercial, regulatory and reputational risks.</p></div>
            <div><span>02 / Advise</span><p>Challenge assumptions where necessary and recommend realistic options, priorities, responsibilities and next steps.</p></div>
            <div><span>03 / Deliver</span><p>Where commissioned, coordinate the right expertise, support implementation and provide oversight of agreed improvements.</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="leadership" class="leadership section-pad">
    <div class="container two-col">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Experience &amp; leadership</p><h2>Experience that makes a difference.</h2><figure class="portrait-frame"><img src="~/images/julian-harper-brown.png" asp-append-version="true" width="1622" height="2048" alt="Julian Harper-Brown, founder of Moss Harper" loading="lazy" /></figure><p class="leader-name">Julian Harper-Brown <small>MTPI, AssocRICS</small></p><p>Founder, Moss Harper</p></div>
        <div><p>Moss Harper draws on more than 18 years of operational experience across substantial residential and mixed-use developments, including higher-risk residential buildings, with a career progressing to senior executive leadership.</p><p>Julian has held Managing Director and senior estate leadership roles. His responsibilities have included oversight of portfolios of up to 9,000 homes and a client-side review of a proposed annual service-charge budget of approximately £50 million.</p><div class="stats"><div><strong>18+</strong><span>years in property</span></div><div><strong>9,000</strong><span>homes in portfolios overseen</span></div><div><strong>£50m</strong><span>proposed annual budget reviewed</span></div></div><small class="fine-print">Figures reflect previous executive appointments, not Moss Harper client assignments.</small></div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="closing"><div class="container closing-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow light">Start a conversation</p><h2>What challenge are you trying to resolve?</h2></div><a class="button button-cream" asp-page="/Contact" asp-fragment="contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
